Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Forms|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add Form To User Site And View No Duplicates
Priority: 3
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User add CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User edit Password CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Form Site|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Form Site|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Members
		|portlet|Site Memberships|
	And Site assign User As Member CP
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Roles|
	And RoleNavigator goto Role Type
		|roleType|Site|
	And Role add
		|roleTitle|Forms Site Role Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Roles|
	And Role define Permission Cmd CP
		|permissionDefinitionKey|SITE_ADMIN_CONTENT_FORMS_GENERAL_PERMISSIONS_ACCESS_IN_SITE_ADMINISTRATION_CHECKBOX|
		|permissionDefinitionValue|Access in Site Administration|
		|roleTitle|Forms Site Role Name|
		|roleType|Site|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Roles|
	And Role define Permission Cmd CP
		|permissionDefinitionKey|SITE_ADMIN_CONTENT_FORMS_ADMIN_RESOURCE_PERMISSIONS_LISTS_ACTION_CHECKBOX|
		|permissionDefinitionValue|Action|
		|roleTitle|Forms Site Role Name|
		|roleType|Site|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Roles|
	And Role define Permission Cmd CP
		|permissionDefinitionKey|SITE_ADMIN_CONFIGURATION_SITE_SETTINGS_RESOURCE_PERMISSIONS_SITE_VIEW_SITE_ADMINISTRATION_MENU_CHECKBOX|
		|permissionDefinitionValue|View Site Administration Menu|
		|roleTitle|Forms Site Role Name|
		|roleType|Site|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User assign Site Role CP
		|siteRoleName|Forms Site Role Name|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And User logout And Login PG
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Form Site|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Forms|
	And FormsAdminNavigator goto Add Form
	And Form edit Name
	And Form edit Description
	And Form goto Add Field
		|fieldType|Text Field|
	And Form edit Field Label
		|fieldValue|Text Field|
	And Form close Sidebar
	And Form save
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Forms|
	And FormsAdmin view Form
	Then FormsAdmin view No Duplicate Forms
Scenario: Add Form With Spanish As Default Portal Language
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|Forms#AddFormWithSpanishAsDefaultPortalLanguage|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Instance Settings|
	And PortalSettings configure Current Languages CP
		|defaultPortalLanguage|Spanish (Spain)|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Forms|
	And FormsAdminNavigator goto Add Form
	And Form edit Name
	And Form edit Description
	And Form goto Add Field
		|fieldType|Text Field|
	And Form edit Field Label
		|fieldValue|Text Field On Spanish Portal|
	And Form close Sidebar
	And Form save
	And Page add
		|pageName|Form Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Form Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|pageName|Form Page|
		|portletName|Form|
	And FormPortletNavigator goto Select Form
	And FormPortletConfiguration select Form
	And PortletEntry save
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Form Page|
	And FormFields view Text Label
		|fieldLabel|Text Field On Spanish Portal|
		|fieldName|TextFieldOnSpanishPortal|
	And FormFields edit Text
		|fieldName|TextFieldOnSpanishPortal|
		|fieldValue|Text Field Value|
	And FormPortlet submit
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Forms|
	And FormsAdminNavigator goto View Entries
	And FormsAdmin view Form Table Entry
		|fieldLabel|Text Field On Spanish Portal|
		|fieldValue|Text Field Value|
	And FormsAdminNavigator goto View
	Then FormsAdmin view Text Entry
		|fieldLabel|Text Field On Spanish Portal|
		|fieldName|TextFieldOnSpanishPortal|
		|fieldValue|Text Field Value|
