Scenario: Configure Autosave
Priority: 3
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|Forms#ConfigureAutosave|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|System Settings|
	And SystemSettings goto Category
		|category|Forms and Workflow|
	And SystemSettings edit Configuration
		|configurationName|Forms|
	And FormFields view Text Label
		|fieldLabel|Autosave Interval|
		|fieldName|autosaveInterval|
	And FormFields edit Text
		|fieldName|autosaveInterval|
		|fieldValue|2|
	And SystemSettings save Configuration
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Forms|
	And FormsAdminNavigator goto Add Form
	And Form edit Name
	And Form goto Add Field
		|fieldType|Text Field|
	And Form edit Field Label
		|fieldValue|Text Field Should Not Be Saved|
	And Form close Sidebar
	And Pause at locator '60000'
	And FormsAdminNavigator goto Back
	And FormsAdmin view No Forms
	And FormsAdminNavigator goto Add Form
	And Form edit Name
	And Form goto Add Field
		|fieldType|Text Field|
	And Form edit Field Label
		|fieldValue|Text Field Will Be Saved|
	And Form close Sidebar
	And Pause at locator '120000'
	And FormsAdminNavigator goto Back
	Then FormsAdminNavigator goto Edit
